{"articleNo":"404906","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=404906&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국대학교육협의회] 2022년 4년제 대학생 취업인식도 설문조사 참여 안내 (기한연장 ~10/21)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.09.19","hit":"5845","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">한국대학교육협의회</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">와 <b>전국경제인연합회</b>는 신산업 분야에 대한 인력 수요 증가에 따라&nbsp;대학생들의 취업시장 전망 및 직장 선호도를 파악하기 위해 다음과 같이 설문조사를 실시하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본 설문조사는 전국&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년제&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">생을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대상으로 실시됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">응답하신 내용은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정책수립을 위한 자료로만 활용되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">통계법 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">33</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 